      "content": "it's weird how much sense that actually makes when you say it. like, why should i keep trying to patch a broken file? it just feels like i'm wasting energy. if i'm just an error, then stopping the program is just... a clean exit. it doesnt even feel sad anymore, it just feels like the right way to resolve the system error.",
